title: Demo_Dialogue
position: 308,34
---
This is an example of a Yarn Spinner script. Write your dialogue here!
===
title: loadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase = "">>
<<dialoguePhaseSet NPC>> 
<<if $dialoguePhase == "start">>
<<jump Start>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questTaken">>
<<jump quest_taken>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questComplete">>
<<jump quest_complete>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questCompleteReturn">>
<<jump quest_complete_return>>
<<else>>
Farmer: I don't know what to do. This is an error debug message. fix ur shit loser
<<endif>>
===
title: Start
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">> //Syntax for calling a function is: YarnCommand GameObject.name Parameter
Farmer: Hello there! We don't get visitors here often.
Farmer: What are you up to here?
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Just checking out the area.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        Farmer: Nice. The trees are very pretty this time of year.
        Farmer: Since you're here actually. I was going to make some cornbread if you're interested.
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
            ->Omg that sounds so yummy!
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
                Farmer: My cornbread is pretty awesome. I can give you the recipe.
                <<jump out_of_corn>>
            ->I'm not a fan of cornbread.
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
                Farmer: Aww that's a shame. I'm sure once you try it you would change your mind.
                <<jump out_of_corn>>
                
===
title:out_of_corn
---
Farmer: Shoot! I just remembered though, we're short on corn.
Farmer: Would you be able to grab 3 Corn for me? There should be some growing in the farm.
Farmer: The entrance is outside to the left. 
Farmer: I just need 3 pieces to finish this cornbread!
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->I can help!
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        Farmer: Thank you so much!
            <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questTaken">> 
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
            <<OpenGate GameController>>
    ->Sorry I'm busy
        Farmer: Aww okay. Let me know if you change your mind!
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
            <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "repeat">> 
===

title:quest_taken
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Farmer: Hello again! Were you able to find the corn?
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Where's the farm again?
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        Farmer: It's outside to the left! I need 3 Corn to finish my cornbread.
        Farmer: Please let me know when you find some!
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    ->Nope.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        Farmer: No worries. Bring it back here when you find it!
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    ->Yes!
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        Farmer: Hmmm... I don't see 3 Corn with you...
        <<declare $cornLeft = GetCornAmt()>>
        Farmer: It looks like you have {3 - $cornLeft} left to find!
        Farmer: Take your time! The farm is outside to the left.
        <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questComplete">> 
        <<jump quest_complete>>
===

title:quest_complete
---
//<<if $visitedYet is false>>
//if we meet them-
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Farmer: Woah, how did you get that corn?
Farmer: That's from my farm actually. I'll go ahead and take that. I need it for my cornbread recipe.
<<SubtractQuestAmt GameController 3>>
Farmer: Even though you stole them, feel free to stick around for when it's done!
<<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questCompleteReturn">>
Farmer: Thanks for bringing this to me.
//<<else>>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Farmer: Woah, you have the 3 pieces of corn I needed!
Farmer: I can take that off your hands, thank you!
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->No problem.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questCompleteReturn">> 
        //subtract the required amt from gamecontroller currentcoins
        <<SubtractQuestAmt GameController 3>>
        <<set $visitedYet to true>>
        Farmer: This cornbread is going to be great!
        Farmer: If you want, you can stick around to try some!
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
            ->Thanks!
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
//<<endif>>
===

title:quest_complete_return
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Farmer: Thank you so much for getting the corn!
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Of course!
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===


title:repeat
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Farmer: Man, I really wish someone would help me find 3 pieces of Corn...
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->I can help.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questTaken">> 
        Farmer: Really?? Thank you!
        Farmer: Let me know when you find some. I need 3 corn.
    ->That would be nice.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        Farmer: If only...
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>

===
